<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title>Phuong Nguyen | Human Artifact</title>

  <style>
    * {
      box-sizing: border-box;
      margin: 0;
      padding: 0;
    }

    body {
      font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;
      background: #fff5f8;
      color: #4a3a40;
      min-height: 100vh;
      display: flex;
      justify-content: center;
      align-items: center;
      padding: 30px;
    }

    .container {
      max-width: 850px;
      width: 100%;
      background: #ffffff;
      border-radius: 28px;
      padding: 55px;
      box-shadow: 0 15px 40px rgba(214, 145, 166, 0.18);
      border: 1px solid #f8dce5;
    }

    .hello {
      color: #d7839d;
      font-size: 16px;
      letter-spacing: 2px;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      margin-bottom: 12px;
    }

    h1 {
      color: #b85c7a;
      font-size: 52px;
      margin-bottom: 15px;
    }

    .intro {
      font-size: 20px;
      line-height: 1.7;
      color: #66545b;
      margin-bottom: 35px;
    }

    .info {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr);
      gap: 18px;
      margin-bottom: 40px;
    }

    .card {
      background: #fff0f5;
      padding: 22px;
      border-radius: 18px;
      border: 1px solid #f8dce5;
    }

    .card h2 {
      color: #c66c89;
      font-size: 15px;
      margin-bottom: 8px;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      letter-spacing: 1px;
    }

    .card p {
      font-size: 17px;
      color: #4f4147;
    }

    .question {
      background: #fce5ed;
      padding: 30px;
      border-radius: 20px;
      margin-bottom: 35px;
    }

    .question h2 {
      color: #b85c7a;
      margin-bottom: 12px;
    }

    .question p {
      line-height: 1.7;
      font-size: 17px;
    }

    .button {
      display: inline-block;
      background: #d7839d;
      color: white;
      text-decoration: none;
      padding: 14px 25px;
      border-radius: 30px;
      font-weight: bold;
      transition: 0.3s;
    }

    .button:hover {
      background: #b85c7a;
      transform: translateY(-2px);
    }

    footer {
      margin-top: 35px;
      text-align: center;
      color: #a98b96;
      font-size: 14px;
    }

    @media (max-width: 600px) {
      .container {
        padding: 30px;
      }

      h1 {
        font-size: 38px;
      }

      .info {
        grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      }
    }
  </style>
</head>

<body>

  <main class="container">

    <div class="hello">Hello, I'm</div>

    <h1>Phuong Nguyen ♡</h1>

    <p class="intro">
      Welcome to my Human Artifact. This is a space where I explore
      the relationship between people, technology, and the way we see
      the world around us.
    </p>

    <section class="info">

      <div class="card">
        <h2>Education</h2>
        <p>Sophomore at Florida International University</p>
      </div>

      <div class="card">
        <h2>Major</h2>
        <p>Business Analytics</p>
      </div>

      <div class="card">
        <h2>GPA</h2>
        <p>4.0</p>
      </div>

      <div class="card">
        <h2>From</h2>
        <p>Vietnam 🇻🇳</p>
      </div>

    </section>

    <section class="question">
      <h2>A question I'm exploring</h2>

      <p>
        As technology becomes a bigger part of everyday life,
        I want to understand what remains uniquely human.
        How does technology change the way we think, learn,
        connect, and understand ourselves?
      </p>
    </section>

    <a class="button" href="#">
      My Human Artifact →
    </a>

    <footer>
      Made by Phuong Nguyen · FIU · 2026
    </footer>

  </main>

</body>
</html>
